  "name": "FStar",
  "description": "F* is a proof-oriented functional programming language that integrates dependent types, refinement types, and monadic effects for formal program verification. It leverages SMT solvers for automated proof discharge while providing a robust meta-programming framework via interactive tactics and reflection. The system supports high-performance systems programming through the Low* subset and provides mature extraction pipelines to OCaml, F#, C, and WebAssembly.",
